---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
const lastUpdated = "23 May 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Confidentiality Policy"
  description="ashmo.io is built on general industry knowledge and original frameworks — not on confidential employer, client, or third-party information."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Confidentiality &"
    highlight="Conflict of Interest."
    description={`Public-facing position on confidentiality, originality, and conflict of interest. Last updated: ${lastUpdated}.`}
    primary={{ href: '/compliance/', label: 'Compliance' }}
    secondary={{ href: '/employment-disclaimer/', label: 'Employment disclaimer' }}
    stats={[
      { value: '100%', label: 'original' },
      { value: '0', label: 'employer data' },
      { value: '24h', label: 'review' },
    ]}
    sideEyebrow="Position"
    sideTitle="Industry knowledge — yes. Confidential information — no."
    sideDescription="Built from public sources, personal experience, and original interpretation. Covers anonymisation, removal requests, and an internal pre-publish checklist."
  />

  <section class="section-shell pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[860px] space-y-4">
      

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">01 · Our Position</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Our Position</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>ashmo.io is an independent educational and advisory platform. All material is based on general industry knowledge, publicly available information, personal professional experience over many years, and original frameworks developed and authored by Ashraf Hassan.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">02 · No Confidential Information</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">No Confidential Information</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>The platform does not disclose, reference, or rely on confidential information belonging to any current or former employer, client, partner, vendor, franchisee, supplier, or third party. No proprietary systems, confidential campaigns, private financial data, internal strategies, employee information, recipes, supplier terms, franchise documents, or trade secrets are intentionally shared.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">03 · Case Studies and Examples</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Case Studies and Examples</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Any case-study, scenario, or example used on the platform is generalised, anonymised, modified, fictionalised, or based on publicly available information. Brand names of employers or clients are not used unless prior written permission has been obtained, or the information is already public.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">04 · Independence</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Independence</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Nothing on the platform should be interpreted as an official communication, position, endorsement, or representation of any employer, client, partner, or affiliated business. The views expressed are personal and independent unless otherwise clearly stated.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">05 · Conflict of Interest</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Conflict of Interest</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>The platform takes conflict of interest seriously. Topics, examples, and recommendations are chosen to avoid competing directly with any employer business. Where a topic could create perceived conflict, it is either avoided, generalised, or clearly framed as personal opinion grounded in public information.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">06 · Request for Review or Removal</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Request for Review or Removal</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>If you believe any content on this site unintentionally contains confidential, proprietary, or sensitive material — or could create a real or perceived conflict of interest — please email <a href="mailto:hello@ashmo.io" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@ashmo.io</a>. We will review in good faith and, where appropriate, edit, anonymise, restrict, or remove the content.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">07 · Right to Edit</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Right to Edit</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Ashmo reserves the right to edit, anonymise, restrict, or remove content at any time at sole discretion, particularly where new information suggests a confidentiality or conflict-of-interest risk.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">08 · Pre-Publish Checklist</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Pre-Publish Checklist</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p class="mb-3">Before any article, framework, case study, course, or template is published, the following internal checklist is applied:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Does this reference a current or former employer or client?</li>
            <li>Does this reveal internal information not in the public domain?</li>
            <li>Does it include private numbers, budgets, revenue, margins, conversion rates, vendor terms, or internal reports?</li>
            <li>Is every fact verifiable from public sources or original analysis?</li>
            <li>Is any example sufficiently generalised or anonymised?</li>
            <li>Could it create a real or perceived conflict of interest?</li>
            <li>Could it be seen as competing with an employer?</li>
            <li>Is any third-party material properly licensed or attributed?</li>
            <li>Has any AI-assisted content been reviewed and edited for accuracy?</li>
            <li>Should this be rewritten as a fictional or general illustration?</li>
            <li>Decision: <strong>Publish</strong> / <strong>Edit</strong> / <strong>Do Not Publish</strong> / <strong>Seek Legal Review</strong>.</li>
          </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">09 · Contact</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Contact</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Confidentiality, conflict of interest, or removal requests: <a href="mailto:hello@ashmo.io" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@ashmo.io</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
